### Ship Provisioning API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/ship-provisioning
@shipTrackingId = SHIP_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new provisioning record
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commercialShipTrackingId": "{{shipTrackingId}}",
  "provisioningDate": "2024-11-15T10:00:00",
  "provisioningType": "FUEL",
  "supplierName": "Total Energies",
  "productType": "DIESEL",
  "quantity": 50000.0,
  "unit": "LITERS",
  "estimatedDeliveryDate": "2024-11-15T10:00:00",
  "actualDeliveryDate": "2024-11-15T12:00:00",
  "delayReason": "Traffic congestion",
  "cost": 75000.0
}

### 2. Update provisioning record (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commercialShipTrackingId": "{{shipTrackingId}}",
  "provisioningDate": "2024-11-15T10:00:00",
  "provisioningType": "FUEL",
  "supplierName": "Total Energies",
  "productType": "DIESEL",
  "quantity": 50000.0,
  "unit": "LITERS",
  "estimatedDeliveryDate": "2024-11-15T10:00:00",
  "actualDeliveryDate": "2024-11-15T11:30:00",
  "delayReason": null,
  "cost": 75000.0
}

### 3. Get specific provisioning record (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get all provisioning for a ship (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/commercial-ship/{{shipTrackingId}}

### 5. Get provisioning by period (Path Variables - NEW FORMAT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/period/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 6. Get by provisioning type (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/type/FUEL

### 7. Get by supplier (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/supplier/Total Energies

### 8. Get provisioning with delays
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/with-delay

### 9. Get by product type (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/product-type/DIESEL

### 10. Get all provisioning records
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 11. Delete provisioning record (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
